sequenceDiagram
    participant A as ManagementContext
    participant D as DLX API

    A->>D: POST /admin_auth<br/>{ username, password, scope: "dlx.tokens" }
    D-->>A: JWT (scope: dlx.tokens)

    A->>D: POST /tokens<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT
    D-->>D: Create Token Link
    D-->>A: Token Details + Link

    A->>D: GET /tokens?page=1&pageSize=20<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT
    D-->>A: Paginated Token List

    A->>D: GET /tokens/{token}<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT
    D-->>A: Token Details

    A->>D: PUT /tokens/{token}<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT
    D-->>A: Updated Token Details

    A->>D: DELETE /tokens/{token}<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT
    D-->>A: 204 No Content
